# Optional: target duration of each segment in seconds.
# Without this file a segment ends TAIL_SECONDS after the narration stops.
# Use slots when the picture should keep playing past the narration (e.g. a demo
# runs on screen without commentary). A segment is never shorter than its
# narration, so raising a value here is safe. Beware of long silent tails:
# every second past the narration is a second of silence in the final video.
# Format: <segment id> <seconds>
01 14
02 33
